From da9ffe28548be9e67f9d9c0e6ce9ac896089337c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Armandas Kvietkus <armandas.kvietkus@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:56:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] amdgpu: vce: add the native vce1 block on baikal liverpool

Signed-off-by: Armandas Kvietkus <armandas.kvietkus@proton.me>
